    PullSword.lua
    - 500pt anatomical sword made of every unanchored part in the game
    - parts trail behind as they fly toward the sword shape
    - drag sword anywhere on screen with finger (Y-locked)
    - release → sword snaps back to your left side
    - parts always being pulled into shape, no joystick needed
]]

